ARutGIS is not affiliated with or endorsed by the RustGIS project.

Anirut Ladawadee changed RustGIS from its main branch of 2026-10-29 (commit 90576c52, after the
0.4.0 release): a Thai interface, Thai text in data, tables, labels and map layouts, Thai
coordinate systems, Thai map sheet numbers, a search of Thai subdistricts, districts and
provinces, Thai dates and land units, and the ARutGIS name, logo, packages and updates. Every change, with its author and date, is in the history of
https://github.com/alexrut99/ARutGIS after commit 90576c52; the rest is RustGIS as its authors
wrote it.

